The [[Heroic Potion]] is a legendary [[Potion]] available in the shop for all classes. When the player runs out of stamina the [[ Heroic Potion]] is consumed, regenerating 2 stamina and gaining 1 {{icon/empower}}, as well as applying the effect of the [[Potion]] above it. It is mostly useless (other than from potion spillover) unless the build is well-exceeding 1.0 stamina per second, and having higher stamina demands will make it more likely to trigger and/or cause it to trigger more quickly.

The single {{icon/empower}} the [[Heroic Potion]] and [[Strong Heroic Potion]] can provide may seem fairly minor, but with potion spillover, [[Amulet of Alchemy]], and/or [[Heavy Drinking]], there are ways to retrigger it often enough that the damage could add up, especially along with multiple weapons.

There are a number of [[Heroic Potion]] crafts:

By combining a [[Heroic Potion]] with a [[Banana]] or catalytically with a [[Cauldron]] grants the [[Strong Heroic Potion]], which gives twice the stamina.

By combining a [[Pan]] with a [[Heroic Potion]] grants the [[Eggscalibur]], which is a stronger, late-game version of the [[Pan]], although it requires large amounts of {{icon/mana}} to activate its most unique effect.

By combining a [[Thorn Whip]] with a [[Heroic Potion]] grants the [[Thornbloom]], which is like a more powerful [[Thorn Whip]] which also generates {{icon/empower}}.

Combining the [[Hedgehog]] with a [[Heroic Potion]] grants the [[Hyper Hedgehog]], which is a straight [[Hedgehog]] upgrade.

Combining the [[Broccoli]] with a [[Heroic Potion]] grants the [[Broccotree]], which is a huger and stronger [[Broccoli]] that gives a large stamina payoff for large amounts of {{icon/regeneration}} generated.
